  p_Description_ad8dc0a6c1bf := 'Vendor configuration bag (JSON, IAIVendorConfiguration shape). Its ModelDefaults key is an IAIModelConfiguration bag (LLM / Realtime / Vision / Audio sections) that forms the default model configuration for every model this vendor serves: the vendor layer of the ModelConfiguration cascade, above AIModelType and AIModel and below AIModelVendor, which may override it per key. NULL = contributes nothing.';
